{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55262","headline":"洋川 二 · 和凝","name":"洋川 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自陪台旆到洋川，两载优游汉水边。\n（同前。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷七三五以「华夷」、「官闲」二联爲七绝一首，系据《唐音戊签余》四转录，後者又系辑自宋祝穆《方舆胜览》卷六八。\n今据《舆地纪胜》所载及诗律推之，原诗当爲七律，颔联二句已佚。\n《全唐诗续补遗》卷十四将「自陪」二句接於「官闲」四句前，实误，今重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}